---

---

<section
    id="story-container"
    class="bg-[var(--color-driftwood)] py-20 text-[var(--color-paper-cream)]"
>
    <div
        class="container mx-auto px-4 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-12"
    >
        <!-- Left Side: Image -->
        <div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
            <div
                class="relative rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border-4 border-[var(--color-paper-cream)] rotate-2 hover:rotate-0 transition-transform duration-500"
            >
                <img
                    src="/src/assets/roosters-building.webp"
                    alt="Rooster's History"
                    class="w-full h-auto object-cover grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700"
                    loading="lazy"
                />
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Side: Text -->
        <div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
            <h2
                class="text-4xl md:text-5xl mb-6 text-[var(--color-harvest-gold)]"
            >
                Our Story
            </h2>
            <div
                class="prose prose-lg prose-invert font-light text-[var(--color-paper-cream)]/90"
            >
                <p class="mb-4">
                    For over a decade, Rooster's has been a cornerstone of
                    Lafayette's antique market and a proud celebration of
                    Acadiana culture. Step inside our massive, 8,000-square-foot
                    building and lose yourself in a maze of discovery. With
                    numerous rooms overflowing with hidden treasures, our space
                    is curated by over a dozen passionate vendors offering
                    everything from rare vintage furniture to one-of-a-kind
                    local trinkets. We love serving our community and invite you
                    to wander, explore, and unearth a piece of history to take
                    home.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
